WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560
Just a quick message for you guys.
The wind blows where it wishes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.900
and so it is with the Spirit of God.
You know, you cannot see the Spirit of God.&nbsp;

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.440
It is spiritual, but you&nbsp;
can see the effects of it.&nbsp;

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.240
Just like you can see it on this&nbsp;
tree, with the wind blowing behind me.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.700
Doesn't matter where you are.
Where you're going.&nbsp;

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:27.300
Remember, God is always with you if you are a true&nbsp;
reborn Christian, because His Spirit is in you.

